    "diagnosis": "<p><em>ATM</em>-associated breast cancer</p>",
    "title": "",
    "legend": "<p>An example of breast carcinoma from a patient with germline <em>ATM</em> mutation demonstrates ductal morphology with lobular features including cells infiltrating singly and in strands. This tumour was ER/PR-positive and ERBB2 (HER2)-negative. The tumour does not demonstrate the high nuclear grade or brisk immune response often associated with BRCA-mutated tumours.</p>",
